The Program saves the following on the computer where it is installed. We do not receive it\par
unless you send it to us.\par
\u8226? Settings and folders: your preferences, the folder locations you choose for Bingo,\par
Karaoke and filler music, venue names and your saved presentations.\par
\u8226? Event data: karaoke queues, song requests, team names, scores and winners.\par
Scores are saved to files on your computer when you end a show.\par
\u8226? Your content: the logos, overlays, videos, pictures, song lists, questions and slides\par
that you add.\par
\u8226? Keys you enter: if you save an API key (for example a YouTube key) in Karaoke Setup,\par
it is stored on your computer.\par
\u8226? Temporary files: downloaded karaoke videos are kept in a temporary cache on your\par
computer, and the oldest files are deleted automatically.\par
You are responsible for securing and backing up that computer. Deleting the Program's\par
data folders removes this information.\par
